# Everything the image builds for itself, or must never contain.
#
# A build sourced from GitHub only ever sees tracked files, so this changes
# nothing there. It matters for `railway up` from the CLI, which uploads the
# working directory as-is: without it, 527MB of macOS-native node_modules would
# overwrite the Linux ones installed in the deps stage, and the local demo
# database — including the session signing key it stores — would be baked into
# the image.
node_modules
.next
out
build
data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

.git
.github
.claude
docs
tests
coverage
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
